7️⃣ Exactly Once vs At Least Once
| Delivery Type | Meaning                  |
| ------------- | ------------------------ |
| At most once  | Message may be lost      |
| At least once | Message may duplicate    |
| Exactly once  | No duplicate and no loss |

Kafka supports exactly-once semantics.

